flowchart TD
  Change[Changement code ou docs] --> PR[PR relisible ou main protegee]
  PR --> CI[GitHub Actions]
  CI --> Check[Build, tests, scan secrets]
  Check --> Risk{Impact production ?}
  Risk -->|Non| Deploy[Deploy preview ou staging]
  Risk -->|Oui| Approval[Approbation environnement protege]
  Approval --> Backup[Snapshot ou sauvegarde]
  Backup --> DeployProd[Deploiement production]
  DeployProd --> Audit[Logs audit et notes rollback]
